# 📊 Observability

## Logging
- Log errors with debugging context
- Avoid sensitive data in logs
- Use structured logging
- Include identifiers (user ID, request ID)

## Monitoring
- Track performance-impacting features
- Monitor key user actions and business metrics

## Alerts
- Health checks for critical flows (auth, payments, core data)
- Set appropriate alerting thresholds
